418
00:22:36,341 --> 00:22:40,691
Add the second, third, fifth, tenth, and the Frobenius error

419
00:22:40,691 --> 00:22:45,041
equals the Euclidean norm of the singular values left out:

420
00:22:45,041 --> 00:22:50,891
