424
00:22:58,014 --> 00:23:00,156
if letters ignored their neighbours.

425
00:23:00,156 --> 00:23:03,155
Spread the letters along its strongest direction.

426
00:23:03,155 --> 00:23:04,440
At one end:

427
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:06,582
