428
00:23:06,582 --> 00:23:10,438
No one told the computer what a vowel is.

429
00:23:10,438 --> 00:23:16,651
From counts alone, it found that vowels and consonants take turns.

430
00:23:16,893 --> 00:23:19,768
Low rank is everywhere in machine learning.

431
