448
00:24:15,203 --> 00:24:16,835
chapter eight's missing step.

449
00:24:16,835 --> 00:24:20,914
So the spectral norm is at most the Frobenius norm,

450
00:24:20,914 --> 00:24:24,177
which is at most root r times it.

451
00:24:24,177 --> 00:24:26,624
Their squared ratio, the stable rank,

452
00:24:26,624 --> 00:24:30,979
