467
00:25:16,662 --> 00:25:19,464
Part 9's subject.

468
00:25:19,759 --> 00:25:23,780
The largest stretch over the smallest is the condition number:

469
00:25:23,780 --> 00:25:26,595
how much a matrix can amplify errors.

470
00:25:26,595 --> 00:25:31,019
Solve A x equals b with a small error in b.

471
00:25:31,019 --> 00:25:35,845
The error in x is at most that error over the smallest

472
00:25:35,845 --> 00:25:40,268
